  <iati-identifier>XM-DAC-7-PPR-4000005850</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-7" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Netherlands</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROJECT TO BUILD THE CAPACITY OF WOMEN&apos;S ORGANIZATIONS AND CREATE A STRONG WOMEN&apos;S MOVEMENT FOR PEACE IN THE SAHEL REGION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to strengthen the role of women&apos;s organizations (WOs) in the return of peace and security to the Sahel region through the capacity-building of women&apos;s peace organizations. Over a period of three years, the project will reach a total of 103 women&apos;s organizations with greater financial support for a core group of 18 organizations, including three regional organizations and 15 national organizations, with three organizations in each of the five G5 Sahel countries. They will be selected in a transparent manner on the basis of clear indicators related to their potential for high impact.</narrative>
  </description>
